WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:37.060
WARRIOR, ONCE MORE...

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:05.040
Ple, where are you?

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:07.420
Big Brother...

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:12.070
I'm here, Ple-Two.

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:13.950
Poor girl...

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:17.320
She can't even live
the life she chose.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.290
It's not over yet!

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:22.040
Mousa's coming back.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:24.890
We can use it as a shield, but...

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:29.350
- Enemies are hiding in Core 3's shadow.
- Why don't they attack?

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:31.270
Waiting for us to move?

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:33.130
She's waiting for me.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:37.610
Haman's going to wait
and then move when we do.

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:39.370
No...

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:40.980
l can tell.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:43.920
I don't want any more
needless bloodshed.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:47.570
Haman and I will end this!
It's what she intends, too!

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:49.070
Judau, wait!

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:50.470
Elle!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:53.300
- Hey!
- Nope!

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.390
Wh-What's the big idea?

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:57.940
It's a problem between
those three, right?

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.810
Oh, I get you.

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:04.180
Exactly. They can't fight well
unless this is settled.

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:05.320
Judau!

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:08.740
I'll go, too! We still
have the Hyaku Shiki!

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:14.260
No! If the Hyaku Shiki goes out too,
how'll the Nahel Argama defend itself?!

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.390
But...!

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:17.100
Elle! Hold on!

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.260
Let me go!

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:20.000
Don't get in his way!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.420
Beecha, hold down the fort!

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:25.240
Right! That's the
Shangri-La spirit!

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:26.760
You bet!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.480
- Judau!
- Just stop it!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.300
How can you let
Judau go out alone?!

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:38.950
I don't like it any more than you do!
But Judau's right about this!

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:43.690
It's obvious there's a connection
between him and Haman! That's why I...!

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:47.290
I mean, all we can
ever do for him is...

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:52.010
To make sure the guy has
a place to come back to, so...

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:58.620
Yeah. You're right.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:04.510
It's all checked out.
You can leave anytime.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.480
Good ol' Mr. Astonaige.
Got something to drink?

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:08.850
Sure. Here.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.630
Thanks.

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:14.970
- Thanks for everything.
- Don't say stuff like that!

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.310
Now go and finish this.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:22.060
Sure thing!

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:29.670
Haman's ship is
still behind Core 3.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:30.500
Roger!

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.070
- Judau!
- Judau!

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.970
- Judau!
- Judau!

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:38.490
Judau Ashta.
Gundam Double Zeta, here I go!

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:01.150
Lady Haman!
It's reckless to go out alone!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.770
At least take us with you!

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:07.010
Don't worry. I'll only be
facing one opponent.

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:09.040
A very powerful enemy!

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.080
Have no fear.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.360
Judau is already under my will.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.240
Lady Haman!

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:28.710
You've made me consider
wearing a normal suit... Judau Ashta...

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:30.570
A mere child...

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:32.780
Qubeley, moving out!

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.880
She's here!

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:52.700
You've come, Judau.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.590
- What?!
- Where...?!

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:06.640
Black Qubeleys?

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.780
Rebel survivors?

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:15.520
The ghost of Glemy Toto.

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:28.450
Leave them to us!
Lady Haman, go with the Double Zeta!

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:29.960
Go to it, Chara!

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:32.910
- My lady!
- You heard her, Judau.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.880
As it should be,
lovely Lady Haman!

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:43.450
Don't die, Chara!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.010
What was that voice just now?

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.460
Mistress Chara!

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.560
Right! GO!

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:06.080
Nee! Damn you!

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:21.110
Who do you think
you're dealing with?!

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:23.290
I am Chara Soon!

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:42.080
Do you hear me?!
I AM CHARA SOON!

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:50.110
Chara!

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.730
That's why I...!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:57.730
Haman! Chara is dead!

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:19.030
If we hang around, we'll be caught
in the shock wave when it hits Core 3!

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:22.550
I'm going out!
Mondo, ready the Mega Rider!

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:30.310
Judau. Do you know
why I called you here?

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:34.060
Yeah, because you're
sentimental at heart.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:38.450
Very funny.
This is the birthplace of Zeon.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:42.740
It's also where
you and I first met.

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:46.280
And now it will be your grave!

00:08:57.020 --> 00:09:00.420
- Mousa's going to hit!
- Can we get away?!

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.470
What?

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.770
What's...?!

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:25.480
Hang on!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.410
The Nahel Argama...

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:38.360
It made Mousa hit Core 3?!

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:41.360
Haman!

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:54.970
It's over, Haman. All your
footholds have been destroyed!

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:58.310
Don't talk to me
like that, insolent boy!

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:11.430
I've taken your rear, Judau!

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.710
You'll die too!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.330
Perhaps... Judau Ashta!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.270
Judau...

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:31.850
Not with that!

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:39.690
I'll finish you off
with my own hands!

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:54.450
You...!

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:56.720
Judau, come with me!

00:10:56.720 --> 00:11:01.330
Your very existence irritates me!
You can go by yourself.

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:05.580
No matter what you say,
I decide my own fate!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.550
Haman!

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.600
Your life is mine!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:17.360
Move! Come on!

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.470
Move!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.100
Haman!

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:27.170
What? What's this power?!

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:35.140
Wh-What?! That was...
Kamille Bidan!

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:47.060
M-Move!
Why can't my arms...?!

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:53.530
I understand. The Double Zeta...
It's using everyone's power!

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:02.040
All their power's in the Gundam!

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:20.740
People's feelings... People's wills
becoming power? Is that being a Newtype?

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:26.380
You must see the now! The wills
of those who died needlessly in battle!

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:30.970
People live their lives alone!
That's what it is to be human.

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:36.620
Not all humanity can become
Newtypes, as you've shown me!

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:39.690
They'll devour the Earth
long before that!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.810
Don't you have any
faith in people at all?!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:47.180
Don't you see that hate
only spawns more hate?!

00:12:55.860 --> 00:13:00.330
Rid yourself of the blood that
gives birth to hate and nurtures it!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.040
I will rid myself of nothing!

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:09.270
Stop thinking only
with your head!

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:22.120
You're just trapping
yourself in your own flesh!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:36.570
Because I have a body
of flesh and blood...

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:38.530
I can do this.

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:41.200
Where's she going?!

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.480
Judau, above you!

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:55.050
I have you!

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:05.440
Haman!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:09.880
While I'd like to call that a draw,
I'm the loser here.

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:12.790
Why didn't you use
your funnels more?!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.650
I said one-on-one combat.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:19.160
That honor you have... Why couldn't
you have used it more wisely?

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:22.360
If you'd used your abilities
for harmony and cooperation,

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:25.050
you could've even saved the Earth!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:30.070
Isn't the fact that people returned
after going to the asteroid belt...

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:34.640
proof that they're still pulled down
by Earth's gravity and can't fly free?

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:38.050
But then our fight here
was meaningless!

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:41.210
Yes, thanks to you
and your clever friends,

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:45.470
I couldn't exterminate the fools
who still cling to the Earth!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:48.490
All because of you children...!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:49.970
Hey!

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:52.230
Stay back!

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:55.150
I'm glad I came back.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:00.530
Haman!

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:03.750
Because I met
such a strong child.

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:26.110
If I can just use
the Core Fighter...!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.980
I can't disengage the Core Top!

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:41.270
It's strange. That tension
I've been feeling is calming down.

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:43.940
Yeah, I feel it, too.

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:47.150
It's over.
Judau's and Haman's battle.

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:49.230
But who won?

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:51.830
Judau, of course!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:55.300
- Where's Big Brother?
- Ple-Two, no!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:05.810
If I don't do something,
I'm gonna end up roasted!

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:09.750
That's where Judau's trapped?

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:14.970
But won't shooting Mousa
endanger Judau in there, too?!

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:18.980
If you shoot where
I tell you, Judau will be saved.

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:22.140
She's a Cyber-Newtype!
Don't trust her!

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:25.970
Beecha!
This is Ple! Ple!

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:29.540
I feel like...
I'm not alone anymore.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.790
Target, locked!
You sure that's the place?

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:35.980
Yes. Use low power.

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:41.630
High mega particle cannon,
standing by to fire! Deputy Captain!

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:45.650
O-Okay! Fire high
mega particle cannon!

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:55.550
E-Elle...!

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:56.870
It's okay.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.810
Big Brother...

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:08.070
- He's coming!
- Really?

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:11.870
- Judau!
- Where? Yeah! There!

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:14.720
- He's coming!
- It's Judau!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.270
That fleet...

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:50.030
The AEUG fleet...
The Earth Federation fleet!

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:53.560
Now they show up?
NOW?!

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.760
Goddamn adults!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:09.290
I'm not really Princess Mineva!
I'm just a double!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:13.410
But Lady Haman
still saved my life...!

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:19.880
I think we can assume the Zabi heir
has been missing since the Gryps conflict.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.930
Why are we even
discussing that?!

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:26.490
You think you can just do nothing
and keep living on Earth?!

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:29.310
- Stop it, Judau!
- Stop!

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:32.110
They won't get it,
no matter what you say!

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:35.430
Then what about all
the people that died?!

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:41.030
Well, Mr. Bright?
So many died! So many...!

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:45.760
I know! If you don't like it,
then hit me and let it out!

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:47.630
That's...

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:00.660
Ju--!

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:24.300
- If you go to Jupiter, we won't
see you for 4 or 5 years.
- Don't drown in Helium-3.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.460
You want to think about
Earth from the outside?

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:28.330
Yeah.

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:31.300
Judau, take care of Roux.

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:33.470
You should say that line to me!

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:34.470
What?!

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:37.740
Stop that! You're acting
like you're jealous!

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:41.930
It's okay! Roux's just doing
that to make me jealous!

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:47.680
If he goes to Jupiter, you won't
see him for at least three years.

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:49.520
Are you sure?

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:55.780
Yeah. If he sees me now,
he'll just get second thoughts.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:20:01.080
Will he? Maybe you
underestimate your brother.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:10.750
Study hard, Shinta. Qum.

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:12.130
Oh!

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:15.080
- Leina!
- It really is Leina!

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:16.980
Leina...

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:20.540
You're alive... I knew it!

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:22.000
Judau!

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.360
Leina!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:26.610
- Did you know?
- Uh, yes.

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:30.250
But Leina had her
own ideas about it.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:32.410
Leina!

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:36.370
It'll be okay.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.700
But...

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.250
Go.

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:43.170
Leina!

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:46.330
Big Brother!

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.750
Big Brother!

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:52.170
Look at you!
You've grown!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.900
Big Brother!

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:15.140
Judau Ashta, reporting!


00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:17.340
- You're late!
- Sorry!


00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:19.700
Roux Louka! Pleased to meet you!


00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>
